Caption←{
   ⍝ Header line matching book example:
   ⍝ VIEW FROM {lat} NORTH, {long} WEST, ON {day} {date} AT {time}
    lat long day time←⍵.(Lat Long StatedDayNo StatedTime)
    m d y←JnuInv day
   ⍝ Latitude and longitude: degrees and arcminutes
    latd←⌊|lat ⋄ latm←⌊0.5+60×(|lat)-latd
    longd←⌊|long ⋄ longm←⌊0.5+60×(|long)-longd
    hemi←(1+lat<0)⊃'NORTH' 'SOUTH'
    side←(1+long>0)⊃'WEST' 'EAST'
   ⍝ Time: hours → 12-hour with AM/PM
    h←12|time ⋄ h←h+12×h=0
    ap←(1+time<12)⊃'PM' 'AM'
    line←'VIEW FROM ',(⍕latd),' DEGREES ',(⍕latm),' MINUTES ',hemi
    line←line,', ',(⍕longd),' DEGREES ',(⍕longm),' MINUTES ',side
    line←line,', ON ',(DayName day),' ',(⍕y),'/',(⍕m),'/',(⍕d)
    line←line,' AT ',(⍕⌊h),' ',(¯2↑'0',⍕⌊0.5+60×h-⌊h),' ',ap
    ,⊂line }
